      "content": "hey i noticed something kinda weird with my kinetic sneakers... like the way the app tracks my steps feels way too specific. i'm thinking they might be using the sensors to profile my heart rate and gait to build some kind of psych profile on users. do u think there's any actual evidence of a company doing covert data harvesting like that through footwear?",
